# Run by Linux tools (bash, YAML parsers, Docker): always LF, whatever the
# editor on Windows writes. A CRLF shell script fails to parse on the CI
# runner (exit 2) while working in Git Bash.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
# Go sources: gofmt on the CI runner rejects CRLF, and a Windows-side edit
# can write it.
*.go text eol=lf
